&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Autonomous Drone Software Engineer to join a swarming programme. As an engineer on a lean, high-impact team, you will have the opportunity to drive development of new features, have a say in architecture and design decisions and have real impact across all the team’s projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will not be siloed; this role spans the entire autonomy lifecycle, from developing autonomy capabilities to investigating real-world flight-test data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is someone who’s a self-starter, can work independently, can work with ambiguity, can take decisions on their own and not be afraid to drive and push towards getting the project across the finish line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership and drive the development of new features across the autonomy stack and partner integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with hardware engineers, product managers, and external partners to define system requirements and translate them into robust software architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement robust distributed state machines, leader election protocols, and fault-tolerant architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clean, readable and maintainable code while confidently managing complex concurrency and contention scenarios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and run rigorous tests utilizing SITL/HITL simulation environments to validate code prior to physical deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in code reviews, architectural discussions, and technical documentation to elevate the team&#39;s engineering standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act decisively during flight-test investigations, applying strong engineering judgment to physical failure modes and release safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional engineering experience in robotics, embedded systems, or distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency in modern C++, with practical experience designing, reasoning about, and debugging highly concurrent systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded systems experience working close to hardware on real-time or safety-critical platforms (e.g., avionics, automotive, robotics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong architectural understanding of distributed systems, with the ability to deliberately evaluate and select consensus designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with robust release management, versioned artifacts, and pinned dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PX4, MAVLink, and related drone software ecosystems is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended social security package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellpass membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Engineer at Auterion, you will play a pivotal role in the successful development, integration and deployment of Auterion-powered drone systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will collaborate closely with the production, hardware engineering, and firmware/software teams, as well as operations, ensuring that every platform transitions smoothly from an airframe concept into a fully validated flying robot ready for deployment. You will serve as the primary technical interface for partners, work closely with them to understand their technical requirements, configure and adapt existing solutions, contribute to core software development, and ensure successful implementation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for an engineer who enjoys combining hands-on technical work with customer collaboration and system-level problem solving, bridging the gap between hardware, firmware, and real-world flight performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate in a highly hands-on environment with evolving system requirements, rapidly iterating across hardware and software integration challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage software releases and perform firmware flashing and configuration using PX4 or adjacent autopilot ecosystems, including sensor calibration, ESC tuning, and system bring-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide deep avionics and airframe expertise, including autopilot tuning, sensor and payload integration, power systems and airworthiness considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work independently to troubleshoot integration and flight-readiness issues while collaborating cross-functionally with hardware engineering, firmware/software teams, operations, and QC engineering to escalate complex challenges when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary technical authority in customer engagements, translating mission requirements into concrete system architectures and demonstrable solutions built on AuterionOS and Skynode.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in flight testing activities to validate platform stability, safety, and mission performance, resolving technical issues often directly in the field during customer trials and demonstrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical documentation and continuous improvement of engineering processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed customer and market requirements back into product and engineering teams to influence the roadmap of the Auterion stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Software, Electrical, Mechanical, Aerospace or Robotics Engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency in C/C++ and Python: you can read, debug and patch existing code and write small tools and scripts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in Linux environments, including the command line, logs, Docker and basic networking (IP, TCP/UDP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on hardware-software integration: system bring-up, wiring and connectors, and embedded interfaces (UART, CAN, I2C, SPI) at a practical level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured troubleshooting: you can isolate whether a problem is software, hardware, configuration or RF, often under time pressure in the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator: you can explain technical issues clearly to customers and operators, and report findings back to engineering in a way they can act on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to travel and work on-site with customers, including at test ranges and in field environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship (required for security clearance and customer requirements)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PX4 or ArduPilot, MAVLink, QGroundControl or mission planning tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UAV flight testing and validation in operational environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with datalinks and radio systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous customer-facing or field engineering role, especially with defense or government customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended social security package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellpass membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verve has created a more efficient and privacy-focused way to buy and monetize advertising. Verve is an ecosystem of demand and supply technologies fusing data, media, and technology together to deliver results and growth to both advertisers and publishers–no matter the screen or location, no matter who, what, or where a customer is. With offices across the globe and with an eye on servicing forward-thinking advertising customers, Verve’s solutions are trusted by more than 90 of the United States’ top 100 advertisers, 4,000 publishers globally, and the world’s top demand-side platforms. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/&quot;&gt;verve.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Der fehlende Wirkungsnachweis ist das größte Problem im stationären Handel für Werbungtreibende.&amp;nbsp;Obwohl Marken Millionen in Werbung am Point of Sale investieren, können sie nicht belegen, ob daraus&lt;br&gt;Käufe wurden.&amp;nbsp;Verve Retail Media (VRM) löst dieses Problem. Wir vermarkten und betreiben digitale Werbe-Screens in&amp;nbsp;mehreren tausend LEH-, Drogerie- und Convenience-Standorten und verbinden sie mit digitalen&lt;br&gt;Coupons, Retargeting im CTV und anderen Offsite-Kanälen. Marken buchen bei uns keine isolierten Werbeformate, sondern 360-Grad-Kampagnen, die zu Hause starten und bis zum Einkaufsregal reichen -eine Closed-Loop-Messung auf Basis realer Kassendaten.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;VRM ist die eigenständige Retail Media Unit der börsennotierten Verve Group SE. Wir arbeiten wie ein&amp;nbsp;schnell skalierendes Startup mit AI-First-Strategie über alle Funktionen und mit Zugriff auf die&amp;nbsp;Infrastruktur eines internationalen AdTech-Unternehmens mit über einer Billionen ausgelieferter&amp;nbsp;Werbeimpressionen pro Jahr. Zur Verve Retail Media gehört seit kurzem der Couponing- und&amp;nbsp;Cashback-Spezialist acardo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Die Rolle in einem Satz&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Du trägst eine Hunter-Mentalität in dir und gewinnst neue Umsätze bei FMCG-Marken, indem du&amp;nbsp;integrierte Shopper Activation Kampagnen verkaufst: d.h. coupon-getriebene Conversion und messbarer&amp;nbsp;Sales Lift, idealerweise erweitert um Screen-Präsenz im Markt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was du verkaufst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein kombiniertes Produkt aus digitaler Sichtbarkeit im Markt Screens an Eingang, Fläche, Kasse), Aktivierung am Point of Sale (über Coupons) und Closed-Loop-Messung auf Basis realer Kassendaten (anstatt isolierter Werbeflächen oder losgelöster Coupons)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kampagnen, die drei Logiken beim Kunden verbinden: Markenreichweite, Abverkauf und Kategorie-Relevanz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;360Grad-Aktivierung, die über den Markt hinausgeht: (Re)Targeting im CTV und weiteren Offsite-Kanälen als Verlängerung der In-Store-Kampagne&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Konkrete Beweispunkte aus Pilotprojekten: z.B. 9% Uplift auf Store-Ebene, 20% in ausgewählten Kategorien&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An wen du verkaufst&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direkt an FMCG-Marken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Die Ansprechpartner kommen meist aus Brand und Media (-Planung und -Einkauf) und verwalten &lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;drei Budgettöpfe mit unterschiedlichen Zielen, Freigabelogiken und Erfolgsmetriken&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eigene Pipeline aufbauen, entwickeln, priorisieren und mit belastbarem Forecast führen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Neukunden und Stakeholder (horizontal und vertikal) gewinnen und Kunden zu wiederkehrenden Partnern entwickeln&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Den kompletten Sales-Zyklus verantworten: Erstansprache, Qualifizierung, Bedarfsanalyse, Angebot, Verhandlung und Abschluss. Mit Abschluss erfolgt die Übergabe ans AdOps Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kundenziele in Media- und Aktivierungskonzepte übersetzen: Touchpoints, Reichweiten, Zielgruppen, Mechaniken Cashback, Gratis-Testen, Kategorie-Trigger), Messansatz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales-Lift-Daten und Pilotergebnisse als Beweispunkte im Pitch einsetzen, um aus ersten Testbudgets hohe wiederkehrende Volumina zu machen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VRM gegenüber konkurrierenden Retail-Media-Formaten klar differenzieren&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feedback aus dem Markt in Produkt, Pitchmaterial und Go-to-Market zurückspielen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So ist die Rolle aufgesetzt&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist ein Individual Contributor ohne Personalverantwortung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du berichtest direkt an die CSO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verkaufst eigenständig, aber nicht allein: Media Planning entwickelt das Kampagnen-Setup, Ad Operations steuert die Auslieferung, Data Science liefert den Wirkungsnachweis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dein Fokus ist kommerziell: Pipeline, Abschluss, Kundentiefe, Wiederbuchung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warum diese Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du liebst es, Dinge von Grund auf mit aufzubauen. Denn bei uns steigst du nicht in eine fertige Vermarktungsmaschine mit festem Produktkatalog ein, sondern du baust eine neue Mediagattung im deutschen Markt mit auf. Die Deals, die du jetzt gewinnst, werden intern und extern zu Referenzen. Sie prägen, wie Marken und Agenturen In-Store Retail Media künftig bewerten und einkaufen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Echte Ownership: deine Pipeline, deine Kunden, dein Umsatz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direkter Zugang zu CSO und CEO bei strategischen Kunden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein Produkt, das mehr kann als Reichweite verkaufen: Sichtbarkeit, Aktivierung und messbare Wirkung bis zum Kauf&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-gestützte Tools und Workflows, die deine Produktivität vervielfachen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn du lieber Benchmarks setzt als bestehende Playbooks abarbeitest, ist das die richtige Rolle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Verve bietet allen Mitarbeitenden und Bewerber:innen gleiche Beschäftigungschancen und verbietet Diskriminierung und&amp;nbsp;Belästigung jeglicher Art, unabhängig von Herkunft, Geschlecht, Religion, Alter, sexueller Orientierung, Geschlechtsidentität,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Behinderung oder anderen gesetzlich geschützten Merkmalen.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Verve provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are a California resident subject to the California Consumer Privacy Act, &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/california-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;If you are located in the EU or UK visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot; href=&quot;https://verve.com/applicant-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Type:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Full-time, salaried employment&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Remote in the UK only.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary Range: &lt;/strong&gt;£121,000 - £137,000 dependant on experience + stock options&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Focal Systems is the industry leader in retail AI solutions. We are headquartered in San Francisco, California with operations in Canada and the UK, and a tech-hub in Poland. We are a Deep Learning first company. Our mission is to automate and optimize brick and mortar retail using deep learning computer vision. Focal Systems has been deployed at scale with some of the top retailers in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We seek smart, creative and passionate people who want to help build a great and enduring company and deploy Deep Learning to the world!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Director of Analytics, you will own the full path from raw data to decision: the data warehouse, the transformation layer, and the BI tooling analysts and the business actually touch. You will set the technical direction for the analytics stack, lead a small team of analysts and analytics engineers, and be the person executive stakeholders come to for a straight answer backed by solid numbers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on leadership role. You will manage the team, but you are also expected to review models, dig into the warehouse yourself, and make the tooling calls, not just delegate them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a rigorous thinker who treats data as evidence, not decoration, and holds your team to that same standard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong technical chops in SQL and the modern data stack (warehouse, transformation layer, BI layer), and you can go deep on any of them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have led or grown a team of analysts or analytics engineers, and you know how to hire, mentor, and set a bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable owning ambiguous, open-ended problems, from &quot;what should we even be measuring&quot; through to a shipped dashboard&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate findings crisply to technical and non-technical audiences, including at the executive level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have opinions on BI tooling grounded in experience, not just familiarity, and can make a real build-vs-buy or migrate-vs-stay case&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the analytics architecture end to end&lt;/strong&gt;, from the Snowflake warehouse and dbt transformation layer through to the BI/reporting layer used across the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set and evolve BI tooling strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, including evaluating whether our current tool, Sigma, remains the right fit versus alternatives like Looker, Tableau, Power BI, Hex, or Mode as the team and data volume grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead, hire, and develop a team&lt;/strong&gt; of&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;analysts and analytics engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Product, Customer Success, and Engineering &lt;/strong&gt;to define key metrics, build self-serve reporting, and translate business questions into well-scoped analytical work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish data modeling standards, testing, and governance&lt;/strong&gt; across dbt models so the numbers hold up under scrutiny&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own data security and access controls&lt;/strong&gt; across the warehouse and BI layer, ensuring sensitive retail, store, and operational data is properly governed, access is scoped by role, and we meet our customers&#39; data handling requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and own executive-facing reporting&lt;/strong&gt; on core business metrics such as product availability, store performance, and inventory accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in analytics, with at least 3 years directly managing or leading a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep hands-on SQL, including complex CTEs, window functions, and query optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real experience running a cloud data warehouse, Snowflake strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with dbt or a comparable transformation layer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record evaluating, migrating, or scaling BI tools, with the ability to speak concretely to tradeoffs between tools like Sigma, Looker, Tableau, and Power BI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating messy operational data into decisions executives act on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication, with the ability to influence cross-functional partners without authority&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating remote-first, across a distributed team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with IoT, sensor, or computer-vision-derived data (high-volume, noisy, real-time)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python for analytics engineering or pipeline work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scaling an analytics function inside a growth-stage startup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in retail, grocery, logistics, or other operationally complex environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring managers, not just individual contributors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Focal Systems&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Values and Mission&lt;/strong&gt; - We are a tightly-knit team with an ambitious mission and a strong set of core values, which define our approach to business and have successfully guided us since inception.&lt;/p&gt;
