&lt;p&gt;At Soho House, a &lt;strong&gt;Senior&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Chef de Partie &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW51313497 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW51313497 BCX0&quot;&gt;supports the kitchen brigade in delivering exceptional dining experiences to our members and guests. Y&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW245981133 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW245981133 BCX0&quot;&gt;ou will be instrumental in preparing, cooking, and presenting exceptional dishes in line with the club’s food philosophy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW245981133 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW12820748 BCX0&quot;&gt;Y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW12820748 BCX0&quot;&gt;our main responsibility is&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW66172363 BCX0&quot;&gt; to &lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW223324756 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW223324756 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW23000509 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW23000509 BCX0&quot;&gt;demonstrate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW23000509 BCX0&quot;&gt; technical &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW23000509 BCX0&quot;&gt;expertise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW23000509 BCX0&quot;&gt;, a strong understanding of kitchen operations, and a proactive attitude towards training, hygiene, and consistency. You will contribute to menu development, ensure compliance with allergy procedures and dietary requirements, and act as a role model to more junior kitchen staff.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW23000509 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW223324756 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW223324756 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly Pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team meal whilst on shift prepared by our chefs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Soho Friends Membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50% Team discount on Food &amp;amp; Drink, 7 days a week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Staff Room Rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Cash Plan (option to up to 2 additional dependents)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dental Plan (option to add up to 2 additional dependents)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Birthday Day Off after 1 years&#39; continuous service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 50% Staff Discount on Cowshed &amp;amp; Soho Home&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In conjunction with Soho Impact, take 2 days paid a year to support a charity of your choice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free Counselling Sessions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cookhouse &amp;amp; House Tonic: Our Cookhouse &amp;amp; Tonic Programmes offer unique food and drink training, events and opportunities to inspire and educate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous training to develop yourself personally and professionally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Events: From fitness sessions to cinema screenings and art classes, each month we hold a series of fun events which you can sign up to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Soho House offers competitive compensation packages that feature global benefits and perks. Whether you’re seeking entry-level employment or a new opportunity to expand your profession, we offer training to develop the technical and managerial skills necessary to enhance your career&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key duties…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare, cook, and present dishes within your section to the highest standards in quality, consistency, and presentation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Sous Chef and Head Chef in delivering efficient and well-organized service during busy periods and events.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure full compliance with all food safety, allergy, hygiene, and health standards, including HACCP and company policies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of mise en place and prep tasks, ensuring all elements are ready and of high quality for service.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in the training and mentoring of Commis Chefs and Demi Chefs de Partie, helping to develop their technical skills and kitchen knowledge.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attending regular meetings with front and back of house teams to learn about any menu or service changes and specials alongside daily tastings. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in preparation of team meals as requested, considering dietary needs and variety.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a proactive attitude towards learning, improvement, and teamwork.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting with the deep cleaning of the entire kitchen before close.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wrapping unused items and storing them in proper area at the end of service.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MailCompose&quot;&gt;A successful Senior Chef de Partie for Soho House will ideally have up to 2 years’ experience in a busy high-profile venue and a natural flair for first class service. You’ll be reliable, friendly and happy to be a key part of the team that strives for success. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MailCompose&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 2+ years’ experience in similar capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for food, attention to detail, and a strong desire to learn and grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of basic food safety and hygiene practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication and teamwork skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive, proactive, and respectful attitude in a busy kitchen environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culinary qualification (e.g., NVQ Level 1 or 2) is a plus but not essential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to demonstrate competency as outlined in the training schedule and Club School&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to work flexible shifts and schedules, including weekends and holidays as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to take direction, work in a team environment and autonomously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The salary range for this role if filled within the UK is listed below. The range for the position in different geographies may vary based on market differences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£17.50&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£17.50 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a&amp;nbsp;Design Director&amp;nbsp;to lead the Soho Home Design team and drive the creative direction, quality, and delivery of our product collections across Furniture, Upholstery, Lighting, Mirrors, Décor and Textiles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with the Chief Creative Officer, this role will translate the overarching creative vision for Soho Home into a clear, ownable and commercially relevant product direction - ensuring every collection feels distinctive &amp;amp; cohesive to Soho Home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Design Director will provide strong creative leadership to the Design team, while bringing pace and consistency to the journey from concept through to sketching, development and finalisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly collaborative role, working closely with Product Operations, NPD, QC, to ensure the creative ambition is delivered through to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Creative Leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Chief Creative Officer to define and evolve the creative direction for Soho Home across each season.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate the wider Soho Home creative vision into clear product and category direction for the Design team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a strong and consistent creative point of view across all categories and seasons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure collections feel considered as a whole, with a clear balance of statement pieces, core products and commercial opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push the team to develop products with a strong design narrative, whilst maintaining the quality, craftsmanship and functionality expected of Soho Home.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities for new design directions, materials, techniques, collaborations and categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Soho Home continues to feel culturally relevant and creatively progressive without losing its established design language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Line Planning &amp;amp; Seasonal Direction&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear category direction, product briefs and creative priorities before design work begins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the Design team is working against an agreed line plan, with clarity on what needs to be designed, why and by when.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance creative ambition with commercial, production and capacity considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review collections holistically throughout the season to identify gaps, duplication or opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead seasonal sketch reviews and ensure designs are developed against the agreed creative and line-plan direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the team maintains momentum from initial concept through to finalisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Design Team Leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, inspire and develop the Soho Home Design team, creating a high-performing and collaborative creative culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear expectations around quality, output, deadlines and ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allocate design work effectively across the team, taking into account, category expertise and capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and mentor Designers supporting their development and creative growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular feedback and challenge to ensure the team is consistently producing work at the required level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify skills gaps and support the development of the team&#39;s capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
